- Lua interpreter (e.g., Lua 5.1 / 5.2 / 5.3) or the runtime environment you normally use for these scripts.
- If these are targeted at a specific platform (for example, a game engine or environment), run them under the intended runtime.

## Quick start

1. Clone the repository:
   - git clone https://github.com/walkerleeadamsbutterfly1-sys/artyluwia.git

2. Inspect a file:
   - head -n 40 script
   - or open the file in your editor of choice.

3. Run (example using a local Lua interpreter):
   - lua script
   - lua v2
   - lua v3

Adjust the command to match the interpreter or environment you use.

